cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "sic-mosfet-devsim: simulation code, configurations and results"
abstract: >-
  DEVSIM simulation of 4H-SiC planar MOSFET half-cell I-V characteristics at 300 K and 423 K, feature extraction,
  multi-temperature inverse estimation of process parameters with a repeated-measurement control, 423 K physics
  variants, and pool-based sample-selection policies including an LLM-assisted policy, with the per-run raw data
  (3,840 DEVSIM runs) and the scripts that redraw every figure and table of the accompanying paper.
